--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MiniDOAS.jl contains a port of parts of QDOAS. The analysis code in src/ (and the NetCDF
layout in ext/MiniDOASNetCDFExt.jl) is derived from the QDOAS source code, which is
distributed under its own BSD-3-Clause license (Copyright (C) 1994-2025 Royal Belgian
Institute for Space Aeronomy (BIRA-IASB) and S[&]T). That notice, its conditions and its
disclaimer are reproduced in NOTICE.md and apply to those parts as well. The same applies
to the Ring algorithm in src/tools.jl and the Raman line tables in src/raman_tables.jl.

The spectra in examples/ace_maxdoas/data/ are not covered by this license: they are
adapted from a data set by Benavent et al. (2020), doi:10.5281/zenodo.3827443, licensed
under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (see NOTICE.md and
examples/ace_maxdoas/data/LICENSE.txt).
